Next, figure out how much money she makes per class. Each class has 15 students, and she charges $15 per student. So that's 15 students x $15 = $225 per class.

Then, multiply the number of classes in a week by the amount she makes per class. 33 classes x $225 = $7425.  

Therefore, Judy makes $7425 per week.

